      "title": "曝光量",
      "sourceLabel": "PDF 第 20—21 页",
      "sourcePages": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "曝光结合入射辐照度与持续时间，不能只看单个相机参数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-6",
      "title": "光圈、快门、ISO",
      "sourceLabel": "PDF 第 22—26 页",
      "sourcePages": [
        22,
        23,
        24,
        25,
        26
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
